{"4800330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Odd Job Angel", "steam_appid": 4800330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4850200], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800330/extras/2993f7bcf61c800053ec45c86a4398f6.webp?t=1786827919\" width=283 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduating college, you got your first job as an Angel!  In this world, being an &quot;Angel&quot; is actually a job where you travel the world solving people's problems.  This includes going on easter egg hunts, solving mysteries, sailing with pirates, saving fashion shows, and a whole gaggle of other jobs, too!  It's a globetrotting adventure where every place you visit has its own job and friends to make.  Now get to work, angel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800330/extras/50f2ab0c6d427d09d7f98ddebb73e584.webp?t=1786827919\" width=203 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 18 different places to visit on your globetrotting adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole bunch of wholesome jobs to play through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute story about a young woman finding her place in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel art and beautiful hand drawn illustrations of key characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boatload of bubbly tunes for you to jam to!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800330/extras/f4e933c55b0e584afb02d7cf1003b613.avif?t=1786827919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a